WEBVTT

00:01.520 --> 00:03.120
<i>You win!</i>

00:04.770 --> 00:08.800
<i>We're traveling through the forest 
to defeat the stratum lord</i>

00:08.800 --> 00:11.620
<i>and turn the trees that used to 
be villagers back to normal.</i>

00:12.980 --> 00:14.000
Hyah.

00:15.490 --> 00:18.370
My, my, what a bother.

00:18.370 --> 00:20.750
I will absorb the felled tree.

00:25.930 --> 00:28.850
<i>The monsters no longer attack the village,</i>

00:28.850 --> 00:31.870
<i>but felling trees will 
send them into a frenzy.</i>

00:32.620 --> 00:33.720
<i>Barrier!</i>

00:34.130 --> 00:37.700
<i>And launch reinforced plastic 
bottles filled with pachinko balls!</i>

00:40.590 --> 00:42.510
That smells so bad.

00:42.510 --> 00:44.430
But they taste great.

00:44.430 --> 00:47.950
<i>Don't eat too much
or you'll be too full to move.</i>

01:03.190 --> 01:05.880
The elder tree fiend stratum lord.

01:06.450 --> 01:08.960
I guess it won't get mad 
enough to come after us.

01:08.960 --> 01:13.720
It was originally gentle, a sort of 
guardian deity for this stratum.

01:13.720 --> 01:16.880
Its attack on the village was 
an exception among exceptions.

01:16.880 --> 01:19.740
This is all the Netherlord's fault.

01:19.740 --> 01:25.230
Be that as it may, we must defeat it to 
turn the tree people back to normal.

01:25.230 --> 01:30.990
Yeah, and pouring this anti-plant poison 
onto it should accomplish that.

01:31.300 --> 01:33.960
<i>The plan is to use Lammis, Kuroyata,</i>

01:33.960 --> 01:37.560
<i>and the old man's magic to pour what's in 
those barrels into its eyes and mouth.</i>

01:37.560 --> 01:41.900
<i>To do that, first we'll 
need to reach its base.</i>

01:41.900 --> 01:43.640
<i>But that's still going to take a while.</i>

01:46.080 --> 01:49.000
<b>Reborn as a Vending Machine,
I Now Wander the Dungeon</b>

01:51.430 --> 01:53.370
<i>On the outside, a rectangular steel box.</i>

01:53.370 --> 01:55.210
<i>Hidden within is a human soul!</i>

01:55.210 --> 02:00.670
<i>In a world of wonder, I go to and fro 
on the back of my partner Lammis!</i>

01:56.380 --> 02:02.260
<b>Reborn as a Vending Machine,
I Now Wander the Dungeon</b>

02:00.670 --> 02:03.100
<i>I am Boxxo! Hello there!</i>

02:03.100 --> 02:04.850
<i>That means "yes"!</i>

03:19.090 --> 03:22.970
<b>Conflagration</b>

03:21.230 --> 03:22.820
Boxxo!

03:22.820 --> 03:25.750
I can't move another inch, I'm so hungry!

03:25.160 --> 03:26.850
Me, too! Me, too!

03:26.850 --> 03:29.010
It's so cold.

03:29.010 --> 03:31.490
Sucks that we can't start a fire.

03:31.490 --> 03:33.680
I don't feel cold at all.

03:34.090 --> 03:37.100
Not when I have this cloak I got from Boxxo!

03:37.100 --> 03:39.260
<i>It's the cloak from the weapon shop!</i>

03:39.260 --> 03:41.850
<i>I bought it and gave 
it to Lammis as a gift.</i>

03:41.850 --> 03:44.210
Don't I get anything, Boxxo?

03:44.210 --> 03:46.300
<i>I look forward to your next use.</i>

03:46.300 --> 03:48.110
Way to dodge the question.

03:48.350 --> 03:51.370
How about you save your 
love life for later, huh?

03:51.370 --> 03:56.080
I'm so hungry, my stomach's about to 
evolve into a monster and eat me.

03:56.080 --> 03:57.710
<i>Oh, right!</i>

03:57.710 --> 04:00.280
<i>I mustn't forget my duty 
as a vending machine.</i>

04:00.280 --> 04:02.960
<i>It's cold, so how about some cup ramen?</i>

04:02.960 --> 04:05.760
<i>No, let's make dinner a 
little more elaborate.</i>

04:05.760 --> 04:07.410
<i>Form change!</i>

04:06.680 --> 04:07.850
<b>Soba</b>

04:06.680 --> 04:07.850
<b>Udon</b>

04:07.850 --> 04:10.840
Boxxo changed into a shape I've never seen!

04:10.840 --> 04:12.090
Are these new products?

04:12.090 --> 04:13.600
<i>Hello there.</i>

04:12.100 --> 04:13.600
<b>Soba</b>

04:12.100 --> 04:13.600
<b>Udon</b>

04:13.600 --> 04:17.270
<b>Kitsune soba   Tempura udon
 Press</b>

04:14.950 --> 04:18.370
<i>Have you ever heard the 
term "auto restaurant"?</i>

04:15.310 --> 04:18.360
<b>Cooking time left</b>

04:15.310 --> 04:18.360
<b>seconds</b>

04:18.760 --> 04:24.140
<i>They were 24-hour vending machine-only 
restaurants that were once built along highways,</i>

04:21.860 --> 04:25.360
<b>Auto Restaurant</b>

04:24.140 --> 04:27.870
<i>where motorists could eat 
anytime they wanted.</i>

04:25.360 --> 04:27.870
<b>Orange soda
 Grape soda</b>

04:27.870 --> 04:32.110
<i>They were a big fad, paired with the 
spreading craze of video games.</i>

04:32.120 --> 04:37.880
<b>Open 24 hours
Auto Restaurant</b>

04:32.640 --> 04:34.140
<i>That is, until about ten years later,</i>

04:34.140 --> 04:37.880
<i>when the advent of the convenience store 
saw their numbers gradually decline.</i>

04:39.780 --> 04:44.140
<i>This is one of those retro vending machines 
that once took the world by storm.</i>

04:44.410 --> 04:47.320
Oh, this is different from the usual pasta.

04:47.320 --> 04:48.920
It's kinda thick.

04:52.110 --> 04:54.120
That's yummy and warm!

04:54.120 --> 04:58.900
The thick pasta makes it more filling, 
and this soup is to die for!

04:58.900 --> 05:01.400
What an unusual flavor.

05:01.650 --> 05:05.070
<i>That's because kelp broth is 
apparently rare in this world!</i>

05:05.070 --> 05:06.500
Me, too!

05:06.000 --> 05:07.030
Me, too!

05:07.030 --> 05:07.820
Me, too!

05:07.820 --> 05:08.980
M-Me, too!

05:08.980 --> 05:10.280
I'll have seconds!

05:10.280 --> 05:12.910
<i>Looks like they like it, but, heh heh.</i>

05:10.280 --> 05:15.410
<b>Soba</b>

05:10.280 --> 05:15.410
<b>Udon</b>

05:12.910 --> 05:15.110
<i>Nah, we're changing the menu!</i>

05:15.110 --> 05:16.840
<i>Form change!</i>

05:16.210 --> 05:17.290
<b>Piping hot</b>

05:16.210 --> 05:17.290
<b>Gutenburger</b>

05:16.210 --> 05:17.290
<b></b>Cooks in 60 seconds

05:17.290 --> 05:19.930
Huh? He turned into a different one again.

05:19.930 --> 05:22.300
Do we get to eat the same 
thing as this picture?

05:22.300 --> 05:24.300
<b></b>Cooks in 60 seconds

05:26.160 --> 05:27.980
It's brimming with meat juice!

05:27.980 --> 05:29.790
This is a keeper, too!

05:29.790 --> 05:32.060
<i>Looks like this went over well, too!</i>

05:29.800 --> 05:32.060
<b>Piping hot</b>

05:29.800 --> 05:32.060
<b>Gutenburger</b>

05:29.800 --> 05:32.060
<b></b>Cooks in 60 seconds

05:32.060 --> 05:35.080
Whoa, Boxxo! This is <i>really</i> good!

05:35.080 --> 05:36.510
It's nice and warm!

05:36.510 --> 05:40.320
I'll say. I like this bread 
with the meat in between.

05:40.530 --> 05:44.030
<i>When I was a vending machine 
enthusiast in my former life,</i>

05:44.030 --> 05:48.200
<i>I was content to go by myself from 
place to place, buying these products.</i>

05:48.640 --> 05:52.160
<i>My friends frowned on this hobby as 
being a waste of time and money,</i>

05:52.160 --> 05:55.810
<i>but I sure am happy that now it's 
proving useful to other people.</i>

06:10.400 --> 06:11.290
Hup!

06:12.780 --> 06:16.030
<i>Kikoyu and I are taking turns 
being in charge of meals.</i>

06:16.030 --> 06:21.220
<i>We can't use fire, so all she can fix are 
fruits and vegetables that can be eaten raw,</i>

06:21.220 --> 06:22.600
<i>but those are a big hit.</i>

06:22.600 --> 06:24.600
So yummy! So good!

06:24.600 --> 06:26.870
There's plenty more where that came from.

06:26.870 --> 06:28.190
I'll have more!

06:28.190 --> 06:30.110
<i>I think I feel a little annoyed.</i>

06:30.480 --> 06:35.490
Some decades back, there was this one 
elder tree fiend that was defeated.

06:35.490 --> 06:38.000
I hear it was burned to 
a crisp with fire magic.

06:38.260 --> 06:41.670
That started a great fire on this stratum,

06:41.670 --> 06:46.370
and for ten years it was a sad place where 
neither monsters nor people could live.

06:46.370 --> 06:49.150
That must be why fire is 
banned in this forest.

06:49.150 --> 06:52.890
But it's kind of inconvenient, 
not being able to use fire.

06:53.210 --> 06:54.330
<i>That it is.</i>

06:54.330 --> 06:56.390
<i>It's surprisingly chilly 
at night in the forest.</i>

06:56.390 --> 06:59.830
<i>All the more so, after all the 
sweaty work during the day.</i>

06:59.830 --> 07:03.890
<i>And everyone's covered in dirt.
If only they could take a nice bath.</i>

07:03.890 --> 07:04.940
<i>Wait a minute.</i>

07:04.940 --> 07:08.520
<i>I have a hot-spring vending 
machine function, don't I?</i>

07:11.280 --> 07:13.300
Here's the next one!

07:13.300 --> 07:14.270
Ready.

07:15.150 --> 07:16.840
<i>First, the foundation.</i>

07:16.840 --> 07:19.830
<i>Above that goes the bathtub, and 
over there's the changing area!</i>

07:19.830 --> 07:22.870
<i>This awesomely skillful 
DIY project has begun!</i>

07:23.740 --> 07:26.190
<i>The handcrafted open-air bath is complete!</i>

07:26.190 --> 07:27.210
That was quick!

07:27.210 --> 07:28.830
<i>Hot water time!</i>

07:28.830 --> 07:30.150
Looking good.

07:30.150 --> 07:32.830
<i>Hulemy's design was flawless, as usual.</i>

07:33.680 --> 07:36.310
This is impressive.

07:36.310 --> 07:39.600
There is, however, no guarantee 
that monsters aren't nearby.

07:39.600 --> 07:41.980
I shall stand guard.

07:41.980 --> 07:46.340
And naturally, I swear by 
the gods I shall not peep.

07:52.570 --> 07:54.020
You needn't bother.

07:54.420 --> 07:58.070
Botan and Kuroyata will stand guard for us.

08:00.160 --> 08:03.730
My first bath in a while, I can't wait.

08:03.730 --> 08:05.980
Wait, what's Boxxo doing here?!

08:05.980 --> 08:07.170
<i>Hello there.</i>

08:07.170 --> 08:10.480
Aren't we going to need towels 
and that foamy liquid?

08:10.480 --> 08:13.400
We can just buy that stuff in advance.

08:13.400 --> 08:14.520
Did you forget?

08:14.520 --> 08:17.710
Inside Boxxo is the soul of a human <i>man</i>.

08:17.710 --> 08:21.050
That's true, but I'm fine 
with it, if it's Boxxo.

08:21.050 --> 08:23.240
What're you two doing?

08:23.240 --> 08:27.530
There are monsters in this forest. 
We've got no time to waste.

08:27.530 --> 08:32.320
R-Right. I guess I don't really 
mind either, if it's Boxxo...

08:33.350 --> 08:34.490
<i>L-a-i-s.</i>

08:34.490 --> 08:35.940
What, Boxxo?

08:35.940 --> 08:37.130
<i>O-ver there.</i>

08:37.830 --> 08:39.440
Sorry, Boxxo.

08:39.440 --> 08:40.830
<i>Hello there.</i>

08:40.830 --> 08:43.130
I'll go ahead and buy enough for everyone.

08:43.130 --> 08:46.330
Let's see, towels, the foamy liquid...

08:48.830 --> 08:51.190
<i>I guess we're the ones standing guard.</i>

08:56.330 --> 08:58.720
This is paradise.

08:59.560 --> 09:01.700
Feels so good!

09:01.700 --> 09:04.300
I think I'll sleep well tonight.

09:03.800 --> 09:05.480
Warm and cozy!

09:07.770 --> 09:09.980
What's wrong, Kuroyata?

09:13.730 --> 09:16.480
Doesn't the sky over there seem kinda red?

09:16.480 --> 09:17.730
<i>It can't be...</i>

09:19.090 --> 09:20.100
Look out!

09:20.100 --> 09:21.650
The forest is on fire!

09:21.650 --> 09:23.560
Tell everyone to gather!

09:38.420 --> 09:39.440
Boxxo.

09:39.080 --> 09:40.220
Boxxo.

09:39.760 --> 09:41.240
Boxxo!

09:39.930 --> 09:42.010
<b>Reborn as a Vending Machine,
 I Now Wander the Dungeon</b>

09:49.710 --> 09:52.080
Black-Black, what's going on here?

09:52.080 --> 09:54.480
No use asking me.

09:54.770 --> 09:59.150
I'm guessin' somebody's burned the elder 
tree fiend stratum lord to death.

09:59.150 --> 10:01.420
We can look into it later!

10:01.420 --> 10:03.490
Right now it's a race against time!

10:03.490 --> 10:05.650
You're right. Band of Gluttons.

10:05.650 --> 10:06.490
Yes, sir!

10:06.720 --> 10:08.950
If the stratum lord's been defeated,

10:08.950 --> 10:11.910
the inhabitants who turned into 
trees should also have recovered.

10:11.910 --> 10:17.250
You four go back to the village, and tell 
them to evacuate to Clearflow Lake stratum!

10:17.250 --> 10:19.270
The transfer circle should be functional!

10:19.270 --> 10:19.850
You got it!

10:19.850 --> 10:20.630
Full speed!

10:20.630 --> 10:21.930
Yeah!

10:21.930 --> 10:23.630
What do we do?

10:23.630 --> 10:25.100
I know what I just said,

10:25.100 --> 10:28.890
but we have to confirm whether the elder 
tree fiend's really been defeated.

10:29.210 --> 10:33.900
If it hasn't been, the people who 
turned into trees will burn to death.

10:34.420 --> 10:37.020
Either uproot or cut down 
the surrounding trees.

10:37.020 --> 10:39.750
Kikoyu, I want you to dispose 
of every last piece.

10:39.750 --> 10:42.210
Shui, keep an eye on our 
surroundings, just in case.

10:42.210 --> 10:44.670
I want to slow that fire 
down as much as possible.

10:44.670 --> 10:45.530
Yes, sir!

10:45.770 --> 10:50.290
<i>But will that be enough to hold 
back a fire that intense?</i>

10:50.290 --> 10:51.570
There!

11:10.090 --> 11:12.580
I guess it's the only way to survive.

11:13.030 --> 11:14.860
Boxxo, I need a favor.

11:15.570 --> 11:17.860
<i>Hulemy, do you have some secret plan?</i>

11:17.860 --> 11:21.640
Boxxo, can't you can change into a machine 
that dispenses highly flammable oil?

11:21.640 --> 11:22.910
<i>Hello there.</i>

11:22.910 --> 11:26.380
Do that, and spread oil from 
here to the other side.

11:26.380 --> 11:29.360
<i>What?! Spread kerosene around 
when there's a blaze coming?!</i>

11:29.360 --> 11:33.230
<i>No way! That would be like 
digging our own graves!</i>

11:33.620 --> 11:35.190
I have an idea!

11:35.190 --> 11:37.630
Trust me, Boxxo. Please!

11:37.630 --> 11:39.200
<i>Hulemy...</i>

11:39.950 --> 11:41.390
<i>Hello there.</i>

11:43.800 --> 11:45.640
Thanks, Boxxo!

11:47.170 --> 11:48.930
Good, that's the way!

11:48.930 --> 11:51.690
<i>Ahh, now I get it!</i>

11:51.690 --> 11:53.200
Boxxo?

11:53.200 --> 11:54.690
What are you thinking?!

11:54.690 --> 11:58.140
<i>There i-s a r-eas-o-n.</i>

11:58.810 --> 12:00.400
Everyone, listen up!

12:00.400 --> 12:04.310
This forest's trees catch fire strangely 
easily, and then burn up quickly.

12:04.310 --> 12:09.690
So, if we burn these away first, we can 
keep that blaze from getting any closer!

12:09.690 --> 12:11.200
So, that's it.

12:11.200 --> 12:13.200
Sorry, I finally understand.

12:13.470 --> 12:15.720
This is a gamble, though.

12:23.460 --> 12:24.730
Damn it all!

12:24.730 --> 12:27.830
The fire's too intense! At this rate...

12:28.160 --> 12:30.460
<i>I'll just have to protect 
us with my barrier!</i>

12:30.460 --> 12:32.430
<i>But its range is limited!</i>

12:34.890 --> 12:36.780
<i>To protect this many people...</i>

12:36.780 --> 12:38.690
<i>I don't have time to mull it over!</i>

12:38.690 --> 12:41.160
<i>M-a-s-i-v, m-oo-v.</i>

12:41.160 --> 12:42.310
Boxxo?

12:42.310 --> 12:44.410
You're getting massive, so move...

12:44.410 --> 12:45.650
You mean, move away from you?

12:45.650 --> 12:47.280
<i>Hello there.</i>

12:47.280 --> 12:48.930
<i>Form change!</i>

12:48.930 --> 12:51.290
<i>A-ther h-ea-r.</i>

12:51.290 --> 12:52.900
<i>Activate barrier!</i>

13:08.890 --> 13:13.390
<b>Points decreased by 10.</b>

13:08.890 --> 13:14.240
<i>Points decreased by 10. Points decreased 
by 10. Points decreased by 10.</i>

13:09.380 --> 13:11.830
<i>That's some real heat!</i>

13:11.830 --> 13:14.200
<i>I'm spending points like crazy!</i>

13:28.150 --> 13:30.840
It's a little hot, but I think we're okay.

13:30.840 --> 13:32.640
You saved us, Boxxo.

13:32.640 --> 13:34.910
<i>Your W-el-co-m.</i>

13:34.910 --> 13:37.410
<i>P-oin-t-s lo.</i>

13:37.620 --> 13:38.900
Okay.

13:38.900 --> 13:41.610
Thanks for doing that for us, Boxxo.

13:41.610 --> 13:44.490
If we get back safely,
I'll put in lots of coins.

13:44.490 --> 13:45.820
Sorry, Boxxo.

13:45.820 --> 13:48.710
I'll smash my piggy bank and help out, too!

13:49.480 --> 13:51.760
<i>The thought alone more than counts.</i>

13:51.760 --> 13:52.870
Thanks.

13:52.870 --> 13:57.010
I only have one gold coin on me right now,
but I hope it helps a little.

13:57.640 --> 13:59.010
<i>Hello there.</i>

13:59.010 --> 14:01.110
I'll pay up, too.

14:01.110 --> 14:03.930
Don't worry, I'll thank ya 
properly when we get back.

14:03.930 --> 14:07.660
I'd never live it down if ya thought 
the Dark Forest stratum was cheap.

14:08.010 --> 14:10.300
Sure, I look black,
but I ain't blackhearted.

14:10.640 --> 14:13.900
<i>Okay, now I can be of a bit more use.</i>

14:15.200 --> 14:19.760
If the elder tree fiend has been 
defeated, that solves that problem.

14:19.760 --> 14:21.590
But this damage is too extensive.

14:21.590 --> 14:24.410
What damn fool went and did such a thing?

14:24.650 --> 14:26.930
They'll pay for it when I find them!

14:26.930 --> 14:30.420
I'll break my foot off in their ass!

14:36.870 --> 14:39.030
It <i>has</i> to be dead.

14:39.030 --> 14:41.400
It might just be the bark that's burned.

14:41.400 --> 14:43.020
Don't get careless.

14:45.260 --> 14:46.740
There is no voice.

14:46.740 --> 14:48.780
It would seem it is dead.

14:50.770 --> 14:55.030
Lammis. Try hitting the trunk 
at full strength, to make sure.

14:55.030 --> 14:57.510
Okay, here goes!

15:04.750 --> 15:06.400
Well, let's head back.

15:06.400 --> 15:09.920
Who's down there?

15:09.920 --> 15:14.260
Who woke me from my nap?

15:14.260 --> 15:16.330
She's wearing boots,

15:16.330 --> 15:19.140
but they're see-through, so I 
don't see those coming off.

15:19.140 --> 15:20.870
Who might you be?

15:20.870 --> 15:23.760
Who are <i>you</i> guys supposed to be?

15:24.190 --> 15:32.040
I'm Kayolings, known far and wide 
as the Shouting Songstress!

15:32.040 --> 15:32.920
Heard of her?

15:32.920 --> 15:34.540
Not a once.

15:34.780 --> 15:39.400
Where are you hicks from, 
if you don't know who I am?

15:39.400 --> 15:41.920
Whatta ya mean where? 
The dungeon, of course.

15:41.920 --> 15:43.920
Oh forget it.

15:43.920 --> 15:48.920
I can't deal with idiots 
who live under a rock.

15:48.920 --> 15:53.550
Yes, well, idiots aside, 
what are you doing here?

15:53.550 --> 15:55.550
Me?

15:55.550 --> 16:00.770
My goal is to turn this 
stratum into a sea of fire

16:00.770 --> 16:11.070
and to kill everyone in it, along with the 
fools who're bothering the left-arm general!

16:11.070 --> 16:14.000
You must be working for the Netherlord.

16:14.000 --> 16:16.360
You know it!

16:16.360 --> 16:23.580
I'm one of the Netherlord's devoted 
followers, Junior General Kayolings!

16:23.580 --> 16:27.820
She's probably some sort of undead,
so regular weapons won't work on her.

16:27.820 --> 16:29.480
Attack with caution.

16:31.590 --> 16:34.630
I thought we were gonna 
trade some more insults.

16:34.630 --> 16:37.400
Well, I don't mind doing this by force.

16:37.400 --> 16:40.830
Attack me any way you like!

16:41.310 --> 16:42.990
You think <i>arrows</i> will work?

16:42.990 --> 16:45.850
What? Hey, that hurts!

16:45.850 --> 16:48.110
Yes, those arrows were endowed with magic.

16:48.110 --> 16:51.110
<i>Magic even works on someone 
who's like a ghost?</i>

16:51.110 --> 16:54.350
My oh my, I don't fare 
well with noisy women.

16:59.800 --> 17:06.660
D-Don't you screw with me, assholes!

17:08.230 --> 17:09.920
What's with you guys?

17:09.920 --> 17:11.880
You aren't just pushovers.

17:11.880 --> 17:19.170
Don't tell me you're the ones the 
left-arm general said to watch out for!

17:22.970 --> 17:26.180
Kuroyata went and "stole the show."

17:26.180 --> 17:28.730
<i>I didn't do a single thing!</i>

17:44.490 --> 17:47.830
At least we managed to capture 
a leader. That's major.

17:48.150 --> 17:51.080
I just hope we can get some 
information from her.

17:51.080 --> 17:52.110
<i>Hmm.</i>

17:52.110 --> 17:54.730
<i>This definitely wasn't because 
our opponent was weak.</i>

17:54.730 --> 17:59.590
<i>This group—especially the old 
couple—is ridiculously strong.</i>

17:59.980 --> 18:02.190
<i>Well, I didn't manage to do anything,</i>

18:02.190 --> 18:05.770
<i>but I can at least be a good vending machine</i>

18:05.770 --> 18:08.240
<i>and provide enough food and drinks 
to fill everyone's bellies!</i>

18:08.610 --> 18:12.630
I'm hungry! Boxxo, give me some food!

18:12.630 --> 18:14.120
I could use a drink, myself!

18:14.120 --> 18:16.080
Oh, I want one, too!

18:17.180 --> 18:21.610
This stratum is once again 
unusable for decades.

18:21.610 --> 18:25.240
I know telling you not to be 
discouraged is asking a lot,

18:25.240 --> 18:28.790
but we'll accept all the residents 
at Clearflow Lake stratum.

18:28.790 --> 18:30.630
Of that, you can rest assured.

18:30.960 --> 18:33.640
Did everyone manage to evacuate?

18:33.640 --> 18:35.150
Don't worry.

18:35.150 --> 18:39.760
I'm sure the Band of Gluttons' legs 
reached the village before the fire did.

18:39.760 --> 18:41.140
And their keen sense of smell

18:41.140 --> 18:44.250
would help them guide every last 
one of the residents to safety.

18:44.250 --> 18:46.330
Yeah, you're right.

18:46.330 --> 18:52.200
But there was so much green in 
this forest, and now look at it.

18:52.200 --> 18:54.380
<i>I'm not Director Dark,</i>

18:54.380 --> 18:58.270
<i>but it makes me want to sigh when I see 
how different things look here now.</i>

18:58.270 --> 19:02.500
We did what needed to be done,
so there's no use brooding over it.

19:02.500 --> 19:05.570
That's right. We tried as best we could.

19:05.570 --> 19:07.040
Let's leave the rest up to the gods.

19:07.040 --> 19:09.420
It's enough that we're 
all alive and kicking.

19:09.420 --> 19:12.050
Life will eventually find a way!

19:12.050 --> 19:16.300
Yes, people can walk on so long 
as they have feet and footwear.

19:16.300 --> 19:19.640
No matter how difficult the road.

19:21.050 --> 19:23.170
<i>I know Hevee's trying to sound encouraging,</i>

19:23.170 --> 19:26.810
<i>but it all gets suspicious the 
moment he brings up footwear.</i>

19:26.810 --> 19:30.580
You're right. We mustn't ever give up.

19:30.580 --> 19:33.600
As long as there's passion in 
our hearts, we can do anything!

19:36.100 --> 19:37.870
<i>Everyone's so brave.</i>

19:37.870 --> 19:39.610
Okay, yeah!

19:39.610 --> 19:41.500
I'll cheer up, too!

19:44.350 --> 19:47.330
Botan, would you mind 
running a little faster?

20:00.380 --> 20:03.590
<b>Clearflow Lake Stratum</b>

20:01.460 --> 20:03.600
Welcome back, Director.

20:03.600 --> 20:06.100
I see everyone made it back safely.

20:06.100 --> 20:07.340
Is everyone in good health?

20:07.340 --> 20:08.030
Yes, sir.

20:08.030 --> 20:11.080
The monsters have calmed down,
and reconstruction is going well.

20:11.080 --> 20:15.470
And yesterday, a large group of people 
came from the Dark Forest stratum.

20:20.340 --> 20:21.970
Good work, everyone.

20:21.970 --> 20:24.540
First thing, go get some rest.

20:24.540 --> 20:25.850
Okay, I'm going.

20:26.180 --> 20:29.430
What should we do? Go home and take it easy?

20:29.430 --> 20:31.980
Things have been hectic, so we could.

20:31.980 --> 20:33.550
But what do you want to do, Boxxo?

20:33.550 --> 20:35.750
<i>I wa-n-t to w-or-k.</i>

20:35.750 --> 20:38.500
Mhm! I bet everyone will be happy!

20:39.140 --> 20:41.230
<i>This place makes me feel calm.</i>

20:41.230 --> 20:44.080
<i>Now, time to do some big-time business!</i>

20:44.080 --> 20:45.260
<i>Hello there.</i>

20:45.490 --> 20:46.330
<i>Hm?</i>

20:46.330 --> 20:48.330
I'll have some fresh vegetables!

20:48.330 --> 20:49.770
You got any fruit?

20:49.770 --> 20:51.700
Everyone, please form a line.

20:51.700 --> 20:56.520
I've prepared lots of vegetables, 
so please line up single file.

20:56.520 --> 20:58.480
I was starting to run out of ingredients.

20:58.480 --> 21:01.240
Could I get thirty each of 
those I got from you before?

21:00.460 --> 21:03.260
That reminds me, Kikoyu was saying before

21:03.260 --> 21:07.020
that she could do lots of business 
selling vegetables on this stratum.

21:07.020 --> 21:11.410
<i>Aha, that's when I had my 
customers stolen away!</i>

21:12.260 --> 21:15.190
<i>This is an even bigger problem 
than Chains Restaurant was.</i>

21:15.190 --> 21:19.030
<i>Hello there. Hello there. Hello there.</i>

21:17.200 --> 21:19.030
Oh hey there, Boxxo!

21:19.030 --> 21:20.320
You've come back?

21:20.960 --> 21:21.670
<b>Family Market</b>

21:21.080 --> 21:22.950
Oh! What's this?!

21:22.950 --> 21:24.660
I've never seen any of these products!

21:24.670 --> 21:27.680
<b>Strawberry milk
 Fruit milk</b>

21:24.980 --> 21:26.890
<i>There s-w-ee-t-s.</i>

21:31.040 --> 21:34.500
<i>Even in another world, the ladies 
have a soft spot for sweets!</i>

21:34.500 --> 21:37.940
<i>What will they choose, cake or other sweets?</i>

21:40.930 --> 21:45.410
<i>The following day, lots of lady 
customers were in Kikoyu's line.</i>

21:45.410 --> 21:47.650
Hello, please line up.

21:47.650 --> 21:51.440
I still have lots of sugary, 
hot stone-baked sweet ruvevus.

21:52.260 --> 21:56.390
<i>It's autumn now, so selling sweet 
potatoes was a great idea!</i>

21:58.980 --> 22:00.310
<i>Too great...</i>

22:00.310 --> 22:04.040
<i>Looks like my hard battle with 
this rival is far from over!</i>

23:35.010 --> 23:40.090
<b>Next Time</b>

23:35.010 --> 23:40.090
<b>The Dungeon Goddess Grand Prix</b>

23:35.020 --> 23:37.080
<i>You might win an extra item!</i>

23:37.880 --> 23:40.400
<i>I look forward to your next use.</i>
